  "name": "Ada",
  "tagline": "GPT-powered science explainer that answers with cited sources",
  "description": "## What it does\nAda answers any science question with a well-structured, readable article — generated in minutes, and backed by real references you can explore in the sidebar.\n\n## How it works\nA FastAPI backend orchestrates GPT to draft explanations, pull supporting sources, and structure the response; a React frontend renders the article alongside its citations.\n\n## Stack\nPython, FastAPI, React, and the OpenAI API.",
